<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian June producer prices rise 6.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenian June producer prices rise 6.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Thursday:</p>
<p>    SLOVENIA PRODUCER PRICES	  June	 May	June 96</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)		+0.8	+0.4	 +0.7</p>
<p>    Year/year change (pct)	    +6.2	+6.2	 +7.0</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
